{"id":51636,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/oeiras-trail\/"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:24:18","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:24:18","slug":"oeiras-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/oeiras-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Oeiras Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Oeiras Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Oeiras Trail 2026<\/strong> (oficialmente <strong>7\u00ba Consilcar Oeiras Trail<\/strong>) realiza-se no dia <strong>22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (domingo), com partida e chegada na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>F\u00e1brica da P\u00f3lvora de Barcarena<\/strong> (Estrada das Fonta\u00ednhas, 2730-085 Barcarena), no concelho de <strong>Oeiras<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>). O evento arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> com o Trail Longo de 20K+, seguindo-se \u00e0s <strong>09:10<\/strong> a partida conjunta do Trail Curto de 10K+ e da Caminhada de 10K+, contando com um limite global de 1.250 participantes.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os percursos atravessam os trilhos, encostas e caminhos rurais da ribeira de Barcarena, cruzando o patrim\u00f3nio hist\u00f3rico e natural do concelho de <strong>Oeiras<\/strong>. O <strong>Trail Longo 20K+<\/strong> (exclusivo a maiores de 18 anos) disp\u00f5e de 3h30 de tempo limite e dois abastecimentos no percurso mais um na chegada, enquanto o <strong>Trail Curto 10K+<\/strong> (aberto a partir dos 16 anos nos escal\u00f5es Sub-18 e Sub-20) e a <strong>Caminhada 10K+<\/strong> (vertente l\u00fadica sem classifica\u00e7\u00e3o competitiva) t\u00eam tempo limite de 3h00 e um posto de abastecimento interm\u00e9dio al\u00e9m do final. A prova decorre em regime de semi-autossufici\u00eancia ambiental, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio transportar recipiente de l\u00edquido, telem\u00f3vel carregado e GPS.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Ganhar Destak<\/strong> e pela <strong>Sport Ponto Come<\/strong>, com o apoio institucional da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Oeiras (Oeiras Valley)<\/strong> e da Junta de Freguesia de Barcarena, o evento inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, dorsal com chip, medalha de finalista, seguro desportivo, servi\u00e7o de massagens na chegada e banhos na Universidade Atl\u00e2ntica (das 10:00 \u00e0s 13:00). Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">22 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">F\u00e1brica da P\u00f3lvora de Barcarena, Barcarena, Oeiras, Lisboa<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2nc